# Sensitive is a column flag

Do not call an endpoint, task, or run "citlivý" or "sensitive endpoint".

Sensitive is a flag on a schema column. Say which endpoint and which column has it on. Example: endpoint `sensitive-column-bound` has `Password` and `Account.Secret` set to Sensitive in schema **Sensitive column - Person**. The twin endpoint has the same columns with Sensitive off.
